{
    "pageid": 4148,
    "title": "Holy Fury",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Holy Fury (HF) is the 13th major expansion for Crusader Kings II. It was announced on 2018-05-19 [1] and released 2018-11-13 alongside patch 3.0 ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Expansion features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Shattered and Random Worlds : Start your game on a fictional map of Europe as a small realm fighting for space, or on a random map with historical analogues for the great kingdoms of yore.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Warrior Lodges : Join a Pagan warrior lodge and raid your way up the ranks, unlocking access to powerful allies and greater military skill.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Legendary bloodlines : Descendants of great warrior heroes will have bonuses that match the accomplishments of their forefathers, including historical bloodlines of Charlemagne, Genghis Khan and others..",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Sway or Antagonize your neighbors: Try to win a reluctant vassal through charm and persuasion, or provoke someone you want to push into conflict.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Sainthood : Pious Christians can become canonized, passing on their glory to their descendants and making their resting place a site of great value.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Coronations : Feudal catholic/fraticelli kings and emperors must find clergy to crown them, since all power descends from the heavens.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New Crusade events: Deeper gameplay for the religious wars of the era.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New Succession laws: A Pagan Elder Council may have the final word in how a realm is divided among heirs, or a ruler may challenge his brother to combat to unify a realm .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Playable Hellenism : A ruler can revive the dead ancient Greco-Roman religion when meeting some strict requirements.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New portraits for the French, Arabic, West Slavic and Italian cultures. [2]",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "And much more: Changes to religion, custom names for people or objects, deeper baptismal mechanics, lists of people you’ve killed, and other small changes for flavor and variety.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Free features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Map and setup improvements (including Tartaria, Russia, Scandinavia, the Wendish Empire, the HRE, Italy, Francia, Britannia, Hispania, the Byzantine Empire minus Bulgaria, Wallachia, Mali, Abyssinia, and North Africa).",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New game rule, reducing \"border gore\" if enabled .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Reworked Crusade mechanics for Catholics and Fraticelli.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Reworked character view interface.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Added flavor events around lifestyle and battles",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Reworked elective succession laws. New princely elective for the Holy Roman Empire and imperial elective for the Byzantine Empire",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New imperial government for the Byzantine and Roman empires",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Rebalancing of the personal combat rating system",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "to be added.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Trivia",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Holy Fury patch was initially targeted as \"patch 2.9\", as visible in some documentation in game files.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The project lead had to sell a 1 full year development cycle to the product manager [3] , probably the biggest development time for any Paradox expansion so far.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
